- Host: `master_ops.build.relay.SpoolRelayHost(path, meta_call, host_id)` writes the heartbeat. It answers only the four meta tools, rejects forged or mismatched requests, writes responses atomically, and returns an `isError` envelope when the native route fails. It never executes provider tools.
- Selector: `master_ops.shared_skills.meta_client_from_config(value, resolve)` accepts the legacy spool path string, `{"kind": "none"}`, a spool block or a Connect block, and rejects every other kind:

```json
{"shared_skill_bridge": {"kind": "spool", "path": "/private/host/spool", "timeout": 120, "require_host": true, "max_host_age": 120}}
{"shared_skill_bridge": {"kind": "connect", "credential_env": "COMPOSIO_CONSUMER_KEY"}}
```

